{"format":1,"key":"zone:elwynn","path":"/lore/zone/elwynn","name":"Elwynn Forest","kind":"zone","label":"Zone","zone":{"key":"elwynn","name":"Elwynn Forest","path":"/lore/zone/elwynn"},"levels":"Levels 1-10","description":"Elwynn Forest is the verdant heartland of the Kingdom of Stormwind, providing the capital with essential timber, gold, fish, and crops. Sheltered beneath…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:elwynn","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Elwynn Forest is the verdant heartland of the Kingdom of Stormwind, providing the capital with essential timber, gold, fish, and crops. Sheltered beneath stately hardwoods, it serves as the proving ground for new human recruits stepping forth from Northshire Abbey. Yet beneath its idyllic pastoral canopy, the woods are sorely beleaguered by encroaching vermin, displaced wildlife, and widespread brigandage.","Stretching south from the gates of Stormwind down to the Nazferiti River, Elwynn is a fertile region blessed with abundant rainfall and dense hardwood forests. Communities like Goldshire and the Eastvale Logging Camp provide crucial grain, livestock, lumber, and raw copper to sustain the grand capital. The region is also celebrated for breeding sturdy Evendale horses, favored by travelers and knights across the kingdom."],"hash":"9881e6","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"eb4418dde6","sec":51},"female-narrator":{"sha":"605aa57d76","sec":53}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Elwynn Forest (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Elwynn_Forest_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Elwynn Forest","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Elwynn_Forest"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/zone/stormwind","n":"Stormwind City","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/goldshire","n":"Goldshire","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/northshire-abbey","n":"Northshire Abbey","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/westfall","n":"Westfall","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/duskwood","n":"Duskwood","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/red